    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS IT?</h2><strong>Dungeons &amp; Keyboards</strong> is a fun and engaging way to sharpen and show off your keyboard typing skills. How far will your typing skills take you?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066680/extras/b8f686cfcf3de3f5f733434f5bf1c125.poster.avif?t=1719501357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066680/extras/b8f686cfcf3de3f5f733434f5bf1c125.webm?t=1719501357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066680/extras/b8f686cfcf3de3f5f733434f5bf1c125.mp4?t=1719501357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grab your favourite keyboard<br></li><li>Lube those keyboard switches (OPTIONAL)<br></li><li>Start typing away!<br><br><i>PRO TIP: Typing extra fast causes a <strong>CRITICAL HIT</strong> for extra damage but don't go getting too greedy as any typo and the enemy won't hesitate to pounce!</i></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomized word list that gets tougher the higher you climb<br></li><li>Level up, earn coins &amp; ancient relics to upgrade your offensive and defensive capabilities to climb even further<br></li><li>Choose between three powerful spells to cast during your climb<br></li><li>Mix up your typing gameplay even more with Augmentations but remember there\u2019s no reward without risk<br></li><li>Compete against friends, family or sworn enemies on the global leaderboards<br></li><li>Infinite floors of enemies with 5 flavourful themed levels<br></li><li>Does having items, spells, upgrades and more than 1 HP sound too easy for you? Why not try <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OK THAT'S COOL BUT HOW DO I FLEX ON MY FRIENDS?</h2>Playing with an online connection will automatically upload your highest reached floor to Steam's global leaderboard*<br><br><br><i>*leaderboard functionality requires an internet connection, the rest of the game can be enjoyed completely off the grid</i><br><br>[/url",
